    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The transition from nursing student to nursing intern can be exciting, stressful and challenging. To facilitate this, the Department of Nursing Education Services (NES) partnered with CIME to offer a two-week Boot Camp for newly hired 145 Trainee Nurse Interns (TNIs) from December 2019 to January 2020.",
